# ==============================================================================
# Obsidian Citation Manager — Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# Specify your local Obsidian vault plugin directory to automatically copy build
# artifacts (main.js, manifest.json, styles.css) on `bun run build` or `bun run dev`.
#
# Examples:
# Windows:
#   VAULT_PLUGIN_DIR=G:\.shortcut-targets-by-id\1KzQrYkpxXhOtOkGJQIWYD76vThVypZOR\Heavy Pilots\.obsidian\plugins\citation-manager
#   VAULT_PLUGIN_DIR=C:\Users\username\Documents\MyVault\.obsidian\plugins\citation-manager
#
# macOS / Linux:
#   VAULT_PLUGIN_DIR=/Users/username/Documents/MyVault/.obsidian/plugins/citation-manager
#
VAULT_PLUGIN_DIR=
